# "DigiCert SHA2 Secure Server CA", an intermediate issued by DigiCert Global Root CA, valid until 2023-03-08
# (SHA-256 fingerprint 15:4C:43:3C:49:19:29:C5:EF:68:6E:83:8E:32:36:64:A0:0E:6A:0D:82:2C:CC:95:8F:B4:DA:B0:3E:49:A0:8F).
